      "content": "been a rough night. just sitting here in the kitchen, probably 1am. one year ago today Margaret passed. can't sleep, house just feels... empty doesn't even cover it. made her coffee by habit this morning and then just stood there holding two cups\n\ni keep picking up the phone and putting it down. not sure what i'm looking for really. just didn't want to be alone with it i guess",
